-- הסכם קיבוצי — שכר ותנאי עבודה ורפורמה בחינוך העל-יסודי (24.1.2008):
-- the agreement that ended the 2007 post-primary strike, between the
-- State, the local authorities and the three large cities, and ארגון
-- המורים. Its period (to 31.12.2009) and whom it covers; the public-sector
-- wage supplement of 1.5%, 3% and 5% ("תוספת 2008"), computed on the
-- combined salary and תוספת 2001 at their December 2007 value, and the
-- shekel supplements updated with it; stage A of the reform (the
-- individual hour and its 4.5% and 8.5%); the negotiation on the reform;
-- making up the strike days; exhaustion of claims, industrial peace,
-- earlier agreements and the follow-up committee; and three letters.
--
-- Its claim on the 2008 supplement is stated in the shared vocabulary
-- (l4/lib/vocabulary.l4), for the root (l4/lib/root.l4) to line up with
-- the takanon's and the owners' circulars' (MMS-521). §4(י) ties its rates
-- and dates to the general public-sector agreement the Histadrut was to
-- sign — the framework agreement of 17.4.2008, imported (convention
-- instruments.general-wage-agreement) — and to Histadrut HaMorim's wage
-- agreement of 21.2.2008, imported.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `2008-04-17_framework-agreement_public-sector`
IMPORT `2008-02-21_teachers_tosefet-2008_wage-supplement`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — שכר ותנאי עבודה ורפורמה בחינוך העל-יסודי (24.1.2008)`

-- Time is counted in salary months: `month` y m is month m of year y.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `salary month number` y m IS
    y TIMES 12 PLUS m

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The registration stamp (15.6.2008); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The date of signing; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 "Between"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The first party, the State, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The Centre of Local Government, for every local authority save the three large cities; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The three large cities and who represents them; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 The employers' short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 "And"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 The second party, the secondary teachers' organisation, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 The organisation's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: the organisation's teachers struck in post-primary education.
-- akn:preamble/p15 A recital: the understandings of 13.12.07 that ended the strike.
-- akn:preamble/p16 A recital: a wage agreement to 31.12.2009 and the start of a reform on the model of "Oz LaTmura"; the rules follow.
-- akn:preamble/p17 A recital: a collective agreement would be signed on the understandings.
-- akn:preamble/p18 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

§§ `1 מבוא`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
`the preamble is part of the agreement` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 תקופת ההסכם`

@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the agreement's period` d IF
    d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2009)

#ASSERT `in the agreement's period` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2009)
#ASSERT NOT `in the agreement's period` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2010)

§§ `3 תחולת ההסכם`

-- §3: every employee in the employers' service in post-primary education,
-- on the teaching employees' scale, represented by the organisation. The
-- employers are the State and the local authorities (the three large
-- cities among them).
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teaching employee of this agreement` c IF
        NOT c's `employer` EQUALS `employed by another owning body`
    AND c's `in post-primary education`
    AND c's `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation`

§§ `4 תוספת שכר במגזר הציבורי`

-- (א): the wage supplement, computed on the combined salary and תוספת 2001,
-- from the salary of January 2008 at 1.5%, of December 2008 at 3%, and of
-- December 2009 at 5%. (ט): nothing for work before 1.1.08.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4__para_a akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_4__para_i
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the wage supplement rate` c IS
    BRANCH IF `the salary month is at least` c 2009 12 THEN 5%
           IF `the salary month is at least` c 2008 12 THEN 3%
           IF `the salary month is at least` c 2008 1 THEN 1.5%
           OTHERWISE 0

-- (ח), last sentence: "the wage supplement and the update of the shekel
-- supplements are computed on the salary components at their value in
-- December 2007".
@ref akn:art_4__para_h
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base of the wage supplement` c IS
    c's `combined salary in December 2007` PLUS c's `supplement 2001 in December 2007`

GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the wage supplement` c IS
    `the wage supplement rate` c TIMES `the base of the wage supplement` c

-- The agreement's claim on the 2008 supplement (MMS-521): for a teaching
-- employee of this agreement, from the salary of January 2008, at (א)'s
-- rate as §4(י) corrects it; it says nothing of anyone else.
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 24.1.2008` c IS
    IF `a teaching employee of this agreement` c AND `the salary month is at least` c 2008 1
    THEN JUST (`the wage supplement rate after §4(י)` c TIMES `the base of the wage supplement` c)
    ELSE NOTHING

-- How the agreement describes itself as an instrument (MMS-521), for the root.
`the agreement of 24.1.2008` MEANS
    `instrument` WITH
        `module`        IS "2008-01-24_oz-latmura_tosefet-sachar_reform-model"
        `title`         IS "ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 24.1.2008"
        `kind`          IS `a collective agreement`
        `is the takanon` IS FALSE
        `issued`        IS DATE_FROM_DMY 24 1 2008
        `practised for all state employees` IS FALSE
        `approved by the Finance Minister`  IS FALSE

`a local-authority upper-division teacher in January 2010` MEANS
    `teaching case` WITH
        `the salary month`                IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2010
        `employer`                        IS `employed by a local authority`
        `in post-primary education`       IS TRUE
        `in the upper division`           IS TRUE
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS TRUE
        `in a population whose 5% step was put off` IS FALSE
        `combined salary today`                 IS 10400
        `supplement 2001 today`                 IS 312
        `combined salary in December 2007` IS 10000
        `supplement 2001 in December 2007` IS 300
        `the kind of school`               IS `another school`
        `the interns the teacher mentors`  IS 0
        `the classes in each grade`        IS 0
        `the roles the teacher holds`      IS 0
        `a further role approved by the district manager` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 24.1.2008` `a local-authority upper-division teacher in January 2010` EQUALS JUST 515

DECLARE `payslip action` IS ONE OF
    `show the supplement on its own payslip line`
    `act to recognise the supplement as fixed for the pensions law`

-- (ב): its own line on the payslip; (ד): the State acts to have it
-- recognised for the State Service (Pensions) Law (no deadline: convention
-- dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_4__para_b
`the supplement's payslip line` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `show the supplement on its own payslip line`

@ref akn:art_4__para_d
`recognising the supplement for pension` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `act to recognise the supplement as fixed for the pensions law`

DECLARE `wage purpose` IS ONE OF
    `percentage supplements on the combined salary`
    `the 2001 supplement`
    `the hour value`
    `severance pay`
    `pensions`
    `pension, training-fund and Dafna contributions`
    `other contributions and deductions usual on the combined salary`
    `topping up to the minimum wage`

-- (ג): salary for every purpose, save the 2001 supplement; (ה): not in
-- topping up to the minimum wage; (ו): (ה) is no precedent for other
-- agreements.
@ref akn:art_4__para_c akn:art_4__para_e akn:art_4__para_f
GIVEN p IS A `wage purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the wage supplement counts for` p IF
        NOT p EQUALS `the 2001 supplement`
    AND NOT p EQUALS `topping up to the minimum wage`

#ASSERT `the wage supplement counts for` `pensions`
#ASSERT NOT `the wage supplement counts for` `topping up to the minimum wage`

-- (ז)–(ח): the shekel supplements in the teaching scale on the eve of the
-- signing (save those with a mechanism of their own and the minimum-wage
-- top-up) are updated at the same rates and dates, on their December 2007
-- value.
@ref akn:art_4__para_g akn:art_4__para_g__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_g__subpara_2 akn:art_4__para_g__subpara_3 akn:art_4__para_h
GIVEN `the shekel supplement in December 2007` IS A NUMBER, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the updated shekel supplement` `the shekel supplement in December 2007` c IS
    `the shekel supplement in December 2007` TIMES (1 PLUS `the wage supplement rate` c)

#ASSERT `the updated shekel supplement` 100 `a local-authority upper-division teacher in January 2010` EQUALS 105

-- (י): if the public-sector wage-supplement agreement the Histadrut signs,
-- or a Histadrut HaMorim wage-supplement agreement (not one for a reform),
-- has higher rates or earlier dates, (א) and (ז) are amended to them: in
-- each month, the highest of (א)'s rate and theirs. The Histadrut's is the
-- framework agreement of 17.4.2008, imported, at its cost frame's rates
-- and dates (convention instruments.general-wage-agreement). Histadrut
-- HaMorim's is its agreement of 21.2.2008 ("שייחתם": signed after this
-- one), imported, at (א)'s rate as its own §4(יא) corrects it. (יא): further
-- supplements for all active workers in the public-sector agreement are
-- paid to the teachers too; the framework's one-time grant of 2008 is the
-- allocation of its 1.5% for 2008 (its §8.1), which (א)(1) already pays as
-- a rise, and no further supplement.
@ref akn:art_4__para_j akn:art_4__para_ja
GIVEN `this agreement's rate` IS A NUMBER, `the other agreement's rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the rate after §4(י)` `this agreement's rate` `the other agreement's rate` IS
    max `this agreement's rate` `the other agreement's rate`

GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the wage supplement rate after §4(י)` c IS
    `the rate after §4(י)`
        (`the rate after §4(י)` (`the wage supplement rate` c) (`the 2008 framework cost frame on` (c's `the salary month`)))
        (`the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate after §4(יא)` c)

-- F-oz-2008-a: in 2008 the framework's frame is (א)(1)'s 1.5%, yet it puts
-- none of it into monthly pay — it pays it to every active employee it
-- covers as the one-time grant of its §8 — so whether (יא) reaches that
-- grant is a reading (convention instruments.general-wage-agreement).
`an organisation's teacher of the State in June 2008` MEANS
    `teaching case` WITH
        `the salary month`                IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2008
        `employer`                        IS `employed by the State`
        `in post-primary education`       IS TRUE
        `in the upper division`           IS TRUE
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS TRUE
        `in a population whose 5% step was put off` IS FALSE
        `combined salary today`           IS 10150
        `supplement 2001 today`           IS 304.5
        `combined salary in December 2007` IS 10000
        `supplement 2001 in December 2007` IS 300
        `the kind of school`              IS `another school`
        `the interns the teacher mentors` IS 0
        `the classes in each grade`       IS 0
        `the roles the teacher holds`     IS 0
        `a further role approved by the district manager` IS FALSE

`the framework pays as a grant the 1.5% that (א)(1) pays as a rise` MEANS
        `the 2008 framework cost frame on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2008) EQUALS `the wage supplement rate` `an organisation's teacher of the State in June 2008`
    AND `the 2008 framework frame allocated to monthly pay on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2008) EQUALS 0

#ASSERT `the framework pays as a grant the 1.5% that (א)(1) pays as a rise`
#ASSERT `the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 24.1.2008` `an organisation's teacher of the State in June 2008` EQUALS JUST 154.5

-- (יב): the supplement goes on after the salary of June 2008.
@ref akn:art_4__para_jb
`the supplement stops after June 2008` MEANS FALSE

§§ `5 יישום שלב א' ברפורמה`

@desc A teacher in post-primary education, as far as §5 asks.
DECLARE `stage A teacher` HAS
    `position share`                IS A NUMBER
    `weekly individual hours done`  IS A NUMBER @desc for a teacher of 90% or more; the monthly hours of (ב)'s table are converted by the Ministry's rules
    `a principal doing the extra hour` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (ט): a principal does an extra hour of work in place of the individual hour

-- (א): from January 2008, 4.5% for one weekly individual hour; from
-- January 2009, 4% more for a second (8.5% in all); on the combined
-- salary, the 1994 supplement and the 2001 supplement. (ט): a principal
-- does an extra hour of work instead.
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5__para_a akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_5__para_i
GIVEN t IS A `stage A teacher`, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the stage A rate` t m IS
    IF t's `weekly individual hours done` AT LEAST 2 AND m AT LEAST `salary month number` 2009 1
    THEN 8.5%
    ELSE (IF (t's `weekly individual hours done` AT LEAST 1 OR t's `a principal doing the extra hour`)
             AND m AT LEAST `salary month number` 2008 1
          THEN 4.5%
          ELSE 0)

#ASSERT `the stage A rate` (`stage A teacher` WITH `position share` IS 1, `weekly individual hours done` IS 2, `a principal doing the extra hour` IS FALSE) (`salary month number` 2009 1) EQUALS 8.5%

-- (ב): below 90%, fewer individual hours, by the table (an input to the
-- hours done); (ג): paid by the position, but not beyond 100%.
@ref akn:art_5__para_b akn:art_5__para_b/t1 akn:art_5__para_c
GIVEN t IS A `stage A teacher`, m IS A NUMBER, `combined salary, 1994 and 2001 supplements` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the stage A supplement` t m `combined salary, 1994 and 2001 supplements` IS
    `the stage A rate` t m TIMES `combined salary, 1994 and 2001 supplements` TIMES min (t's `position share`) 1

-- (ד): counts for percentage supplements, not for the hour value; (ה):
-- pensionable.
@ref akn:art_5__para_d akn:art_5__para_e
GIVEN p IS A `wage purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the stage A supplement counts for` p IF
       p EQUALS `percentage supplements on the combined salary`
    OR p EQUALS `pensions`
    OR p EQUALS `pension, training-fund and Dafna contributions`

-- (ו): an individual hour is work with a group of one to five pupils, as
-- the principal decides with the teacher; 5.ו.1–5.ו.2: the organisation's
-- position (up to three) binds no employer.
@ref akn:art_5__para_f akn:art_5__para_f__subpara_1 akn:art_5__para_f__subpara_2
GIVEN pupils IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an individual group` pupils IF
    pupils AT LEAST 1 AND pupils AT MOST 5

-- (ז): the hour is in the work plan; (ח): it does not change the position;
-- (יא): it values no hour of work nor any managerial flexibility; (יב): the
-- organisation asks nothing more for the principals' powers on tenure and
-- hiring.
@ref akn:art_5__para_g akn:art_5__para_h akn:art_5__para_ja akn:art_5__para_jb
`the individual hour changes the position` MEANS FALSE

-- (י): stage A's supplement goes on after June 2008 only if the parties
-- agreed a full reform by then; else it stops, and so does the hour.
@ref akn:art_5__para_j
GIVEN `a full reform agreed by June 2008` IS A BOOLEAN, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `stage A is paid in` `a full reform agreed by June 2008` m IF
    m AT MOST `salary month number` 2008 6 OR `a full reform agreed by June 2008`

§§ `6 משא ומתן על רפורמה`

DECLARE `reform action` IS ONE OF
    `negotiate an agreed reform`
    `join a reform the organisation has not agreed`

-- (א)–(ב): negotiation at once, on the "Oz LaTmura" model, the reform's
-- supplement at most 26%, to be agreed within four months (two more if
-- needed); (ג): failing that, each keeps its claims; (ד): an existing
-- teacher need not join a reform the organisation has not agreed.
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6__para_a akn:art_6__para_b akn:art_6__para_c
`negotiating the reform` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `negotiate an agreed reform`
    WITHIN 6

`the most the reform may add` MEANS 26%

@ref akn:art_6__para_d
`an existing teacher may be made to join a reform the organisation has not agreed` MEANS FALSE

§§ `7 החזר ימי שביתה`

@desc A teacher's undertaking to make up the strike days, as §7 asks.
DECLARE `strike-days teacher` HAS
    `share of the days undertaken`   IS A NUMBER @desc 1 for the whole plan
    `pay for the days to be made up` IS A NUMBER
    `paid by the owner for strike days` IS A NUMBER @desc against the Ministry's instructions

-- (א)–(ב): the days are made up in תשס"ח by the plan, and one who
-- undertook the whole plan is advanced 50% of their pay in the salary of
-- December 2007; (ד): less what an owner paid for strike days. The
-- illegible cross-reference in (ד) is read as (ב), the only advance.
@ref akn:art_7 akn:art_7__para_a akn:art_7__para_b akn:art_7__para_d
GIVEN t IS A `strike-days teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the advance` t IS
    IF t's `share of the days undertaken` EQUALS 1
    THEN `not below zero` (50% TIMES t's `pay for the days to be made up` MINUS t's `paid by the owner for strike days`)
    ELSE 0

-- (ג): for contributions, the advance is the pay for the days.
@ref akn:art_7__para_c
`the advance counts as pay for contributions` MEANS TRUE

-- (ה): Hanukkah pay in full for the whole plan, in proportion for part of
-- it; half in December 2007 and half in June 2008.
@ref akn:art_7__para_e
GIVEN t IS A `strike-days teacher`, `Hanukkah pay` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Hanukkah pay` t `Hanukkah pay` IS
    `Hanukkah pay` TIMES min (t's `share of the days undertaken`) 1

-- (ו): the rest (50%) in the salary of June 2008; (ז): one who does not
-- keep the undertaking repays the advance for what was not done, by the
-- salary of December 2008; (ח): the teacher signs the plan and the
-- consent to that deduction.
@ref akn:art_7__para_f akn:art_7__para_g akn:art_7__para_h
GIVEN `advance received` IS A NUMBER, `share of the undertaking not done` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the deduction for days not made up` `advance received` `share of the undertaking not done` IS
    `advance received` TIMES `share of the undertaking not done`

#ASSERT `the deduction for days not made up` 1000 0.25 EQUALS 250

§§ `8–13`

DECLARE `agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `discuss the further issues`
    `strike or lock out over a settled matter`
    `decide a dispute about the agreement`

-- §8: the further issues the organisation raised are discussed within 60
-- days of the understandings.
@ref akn:art_8 akn:art_8/p1
`the further issues` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `discuss the further issues`
    WITHIN 60

-- §9: the labour dispute of 17.12.2006 is void.
@ref akn:art_9 akn:art_9/p1
`the labour dispute of 17.12.2006 stands` MEANS FALSE

-- §10: subject to §4(י), the agreement exhausts the claims on §§4 and 7 to
-- 31.12.2009 (and §11 of the agreement of 18.12.2001), and on §5 to
-- 30.6.2008.
@ref akn:art_10 akn:art_10__para_a akn:art_10__para_b
GIVEN `section of the agreement` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `claims on the section are exhausted to` `section of the agreement` d IF
    IF `section of the agreement` EQUALS 5
    THEN d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2008)
    ELSE d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2009)

-- §11: industrial peace on what was settled, for the period; on §§5–6 to
-- June 2008; the reform is not a settled matter.
@ref akn:art_11 akn:art_11/p1 akn:art_11/p2
`industrial peace` MEANS
    PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
    SHANT `strike or lock out over a settled matter`

-- §12: earlier agreements stand unless this one changes them.
@ref akn:art_12 akn:art_12/p1
`earlier terms stand unless this agreement changes them` MEANS TRUE

-- §13: a parity follow-up committee decides disputes unanimously, meeting
-- within 21 days of a request.
@ref akn:art_13 akn:art_13/p1
`deciding a dispute` MEANS
    PARTY `the parity committee`
    MUST  `decide a dispute about the agreement`
    WITHIN 21

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signing formula; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The parties signing; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p3 The file number; no rule.

